<title>USA: Continental plans $250 mln notes issue.</title>
<headline>Continental plans $250 mln notes issue.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines Inc said on Wednesday that it plans to issue $250 million of 9-1/2 percent Senior Notes due December 15, 2001, in a private placement.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the offering will be used for general corporate purposes, the airline said.</p>
<p>The closing of the offering, subject to certain conditions, is expected next week, Continental said.</p>
</text>
